## Getting Started

### Prerequisites

- [Nix](https://nixos.org/download/) with flakes enabled
- [direnv](https://direnv.net/) (recommended) or run `nix develop github:tyler43636/ansible-ai-template` manually

### Setup

1. **Enter the development shell:**
   ```bash
   direnv allow    # if using direnv
   # OR
   nix develop github:tyler43636/ansible-ai-template
   ```

2. **Install required collections:**
   ```bash
   just install
   ```
{% if vault_enabled %}

3. **Vault password:**
   A `.vault_pass` file was generated during scaffolding. Replace its contents with your actual vault password. Never commit this file.
{% endif %}

## Usage

```bash
# Lint all playbooks and roles
just lint

# Syntax check
just syntax
{% if molecule_enabled %}

# Run Molecule tests
just molecule

# Full test suite
just test
{% endif %}
```

## Updating the dev shell

```bash
just self-update
```

